  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Working together to fight antimicrobial resistance (AMR) in Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall strategic objective is to contribute to partner countries preparedness  to tackle AMR as described in the 2017 EU action plan, engaging with major global players and strategic countries and contributing towards achieving the objectives of the Global Action Plan on AMR by sharing experiences, advocating best practices and stimulating actions outside the EU by working with targeted Asian partner countries.</narrative>
  </description>
